# Conventions

Full instructions for AI tools are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Read it first and follow it.

- Edit Markdown only unless asked otherwise; keep section names and front matter keys intact.
- Do not invent citations, statutes or figures; mark anything unverified.
- Keep protected personal data out of all files.
- No hard-coded model IDs or secrets; scripts use only the standard library.
- After changes: `python scripts/build_catalog.py && python scripts/validate_repo.py && pytest tests`.
